    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d514-a6">

                <pb facs="0743" n="723" xml:id="pg723"/>

                <head><hi rendition="#italic">Certificate of clearance.</hi></head>
                <p><hi rendition="#small-caps">Port of Green Turtle Cay, Abaco,</hi>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Office of Collector of Revenue.</hi></p>
                <p>These are to certify to all whom it doth concern that the British sloop Racer,
                    whereof ------------ Russell is master, has been duly cleared at this office for
                    Beau fort, in Port Royal, South Carolina, in ballast.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">Given under my hand, at the aforesaid port,
                            <date calendar="gregorian" when="1864-07-26">this 26th day of July, in
                            the year of our Lord 1864</date>.</dateline>
                    <lb/>
                    <signed>JOSEPH J. LOWNDERS, <hi rendition="#italic">Collector of
                        Revenue.</hi></signed></closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
